\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r,T,S,U,V,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\alpha\\in V\">\\(r,T,S,U,V,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\alpha\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span>（标准概率空间谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\)</span>（遍历保测变换谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"11a66aa01f6e941d\" href=\"?note=11a66aa01f6e941d\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md\">../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\\subseteq V^7\\)</span>（保测映射谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\\)</span>（可数可测划分熵谓词，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"a95c8ce648dde2ec\" href=\"?note=a95c8ce648dde2ec\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma_X\">\\(\\sigma_X\\)</span>（生成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数算子，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"e03c77e7d23896d9\" href=\"?note=e03c77e7d23896d9\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md\">../batch08/58-df-sigma-generated.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\\subseteq V^6\">\\(\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\\subseteq V^6\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> 在本原子中定义</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}map\\text{-}equality\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(U,V,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\nU,V\\in X^X\n\\land\\{x\\in X:U(x)\\ne V(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:U(x)\\ne V(x)\\})=0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}map\\text{-}equality\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(U,V,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\nU,V\\in X^X\n\\land\\{x\\in X:U(x)\\ne V(x)\\}\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(\\{x\\in X:U(x)\\ne V(x)\\})=0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}pair\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\n(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F,X,X)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\n(S,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(S\\circ T,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(T\\circ S,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}inverse\\text{-}pair\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\n(T,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F,X,X)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasMeasurePreservingMap}_S\n(S,\\mu,\\mu,\\mathcal F,\\mathcal F,X,X)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(S\\circ T,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{EqMapAE}_S(T\\circ S,\\operatorname{id}_X,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generates\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\n(\\alpha,T,S,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal F\n\\land\\bigcup\\alpha=X\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\alpha\\;(A\\ne B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists B\\in\n\\sigma_X\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\n\\left(\n\\{(T^k)^{-1}[C]:C\\in\\alpha\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(S^k)^{-1}[C]:C\\in\\alpha\\}\n\\right)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\bigl(A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generates\\text{-}modulo\\text{-}null}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\n(\\alpha,T,S,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;\\alpha\\subseteq\\mathcal F\n\\land\\bigcup\\alpha=X\n\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\alpha\\;(A\\ne B\\to A\\cap B=\\varnothing)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathcal F\\;\\exists B\\in\n\\sigma_X\\!\\left(\n\\bigcup_{k\\in\\omega}\n\\left(\n\\{(T^k)^{-1}[C]:C\\in\\alpha\\}\n\\cup\n\\{(S^k)^{-1}[C]:C\\in\\alpha\\}\n\\right)\n\\right)\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{18mm}\n\\bigl(A\\mathbin\\triangle B\\in\\mathcal F\n\\land\\mu(A\\mathbin\\triangle B)=0\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rokhlin\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S(r,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\nr=\\inf\\Bigl\\{\nh\\in[0,\\infty]:\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\n(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\alpha,h)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\n(\\alpha,T,S,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{df\\text{-}rokhlin\\text{-}entropy\\text{-}value}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S(r,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\leftrightarrow\\\\\n&amp;r\\in[0,\\infty]\n\\land\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\\Biggl(\n\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\nr=\\inf\\Bigl\\{\nh\\in[0,\\infty]:\n\\exists\\alpha\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure7EntropyOfPartition}_S\n(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,\\alpha,h)\n\\land\n\\mathrm{GeneratesModuloNull}_S\n(\\alpha,T,S,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\bigr)\n\\Bigr\\}\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rokip}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!r\\in[0,\\infty]\\;\n\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S(r,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}rokip}\\vdash\n&amp;\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure8StandardProbabilitySpace}_S(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\n\\land\\mathrm{Ergodic}_S(T,\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\\\\n&amp;{}\\land\\exists S\\in V\\;\n\\mathrm{InversePairModNull}_S(S,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists!r\\in[0,\\infty]\\;\n\\mathrm{RokhlinEntropyValue}_S(r,T,X,\\mathcal F,\\mu).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>下确界而非最小值是定义的一部分；最优生成划分未必存在。</li>\n<li>对可逆遍历 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb Z\">\\(\\mathbb Z\\)</span>-作用，该量与 Kolmogorov–Sinai 熵一致。</li>\n<li>Hashimoto 矩阵与此处的 Rokhlin 熵没有直接定义依赖。</li>\n<li>模零可逆性现在由一个双边保测逆见证及两条几乎处处复合等式定义；整数时间的负向迭代由该见证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 表达。</li>\n<li>“生成模零”逐事件要求与双向迭代划分生成的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma\">\\(\\sigma\\)</span>-代数中的某个集合相差零测集，不再把模零等号留作未定义符号。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md","status":"resolved","id":"11a66aa01f6e941d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-ergodic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition.md","status":"resolved","id":"a95c8ce648dde2ec","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-measure7-entropy-of-partition.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure8-standard-probability-space.md","status":"resolved","id":"401407224816e743","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-zfc-measure8-standard-p